  "solution": "Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>Δ</mi></semantics></math> là tiếp tuyến cần tìm và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> là tiếp điểm. Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Δ</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>Δ</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇔</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>Δ</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mn>3</mn><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>⇔</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t<ul><li>Với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⇒</mo></mrow></semantics></math> tiếp điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, vậy phương trình tiếp tuyến là <div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Δ</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></li><li>Với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo></mrow></semantics></math> tiếp điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, vậy phương trình tiếp tuyến là <div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Δ</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></li></ul>",
